[PH] Greetings, <class>. Beside me is the Mission Table. From it, you can assign our troops to complete vital assignments across the Broken Isles.

Give it a try now, master. We have received word of a small demon attack on the city of Dalaran. Let us send someone to help repel the enemy.

Gaze upon the Mission Table and send a Champion to Dalaran. 
 See if you've already completed this by typing:

 /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(42143))
