When Mayla's father was taken, so were the corpses of several of our greatest chieftains.

The Grey One, even now, is priming Mayla's father to be a vessel for his evil agenda.

But the others have already been taken by the necrodark, their corpses now vessels for malevolent drogbar spirits.

I will be honest, I do not think my skills could defeat these monstrosities.

We need your help! 
