I came here to exorcise the manor. Unfortunately it's haunted by a wizard, and he's summoned quite a few wraiths to bolster his power.

I'm no match for them, but perhaps you are. My gun can harvest the wraiths' ectoplasmic energy. Then we can turn it against him.

By my estimates, you'll need to zap 7 wraiths before the gun is fully charged. Here, take it. 
